{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"Сунан Абу Дауд","section":{"36":"Signet-Rings (Kitab Al-Khatam)"},"section_detail":{"36":{"hadithnumber_first":4214,"hadithnumber_last":4239,"arabicnumber_first":4214,"arabicnumber_last":4239,"name_native":"Перстни-печатки (Китаб Аль-Хатам)"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4228,"arabicnumber":4228,"text":"Нафи‘ передаёт, что Ибн ‘Умар, да будет доволен Аллах им и его отцом, носил перстень на левой руке","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih Isnaad"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih Isnaad"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":36,"hadith":15}}]}